id: pm-ts-starter-sdk-toon-codec
title: Use public SDK TOON codecs in generated backend projects
description: Replace generated standalone CLI direct codec dependency with public SDK codecs; preserve certified read-only receipts and document the supported host contract.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ts-starter#197",sdk-adoption,template
created_at: "2026-11-06T18:46:27.416Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-07T02:12:06.874Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Generated imports and manifests agree on a supported SDK floor; real non-git tracker JSON/TOON round trips preserve representation and source state; regression tests fail on behavioral revert; document SDK codec pattern
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T18:46:39.844Z",codex-sol,"Scope: companion pm-cli-website-25wb and adoption audit S1. Inventory: backend-project.ts generates one direct production encode call and a direct codec manifest dependency; test/backend.test.ts directly decodes the generated CLI output. The package itself has no direct codec dependency. Replace these with public SDK codecs, retain read-only adapter policy and complete-list certification, and verify real non-git tracker output, inertness and generated SDK floor. Companion tracker remains read-only."
  "2026-11-06T18:51:00.094Z",codex-sol,"Public codec exports are present at exact generated floor 2026.10.17; peer range, dev pin and manifest remain aligned without a toolchain bump. Updated generated CLI and test imports to encodeToon/decodeToon from the public SDK, removed the generated direct codec dependency, and documented why application read-only/refusal/certification policy remains. Real non-git npm/Bun consumers and SDK harness pass 13/13 targeted tests. Disposable-copy behavioral reverts: restoring buildBackendProjectFiles alone fails host-owns-codec dependency contract; restoring cliSource alone fails generated build with TS2307 for the unsupported direct codec import. Fixed implementation rerun passes 13/13. Linked-test execution exposed inherited npm_config_allow_scripts causing EALLOWSCRIPTS in nested installs; consumer child environment now removes that setting and npm credential variables."
  "2026-11-06T19:05:49.100Z",codex-sol,"PR #197 is open at d2beea9. Targeted linked test rerun passes 13/13 with zero skips. Local strict health confirms history verification is healthy but reports inherited provenance advisory already tracked by pm-ts-starter-health-legacy-1027 and local extension-host version skew; no history rewrite or duplicate follow-up is needed. Full npm gate is running with a temporary home and disabled global/system Git configuration; Bun follows serially. CI jobs are queued for runners. CodeRabbit review is queued through the required pipeline; automatic skips, trial expiry and reviewer quotas are missing evidence, not approval."
  "2026-11-06T19:24:49.250Z",codex-sol,"Implementation and local acceptance complete: node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/backend.test.ts passes 13/13 with zero skips, including the pm-linked run; npm run lint, npm run typecheck, npm run build:test and changelog check pass. Both isolated behavioral reverts fail and restored implementation passes. Per task instruction CI owns full npm and Bun release:check gates. An extra local npm full-gate attempt was stopped during unrelated compiler-cache tests after passing the generated consumer, crash-recovery and compiler-layout matrices; it is incomplete, not a pass. PR #197 first-head CI passed tracker health, committed-dist checks and CodeQL; full gates remain pending. CodeRabbit is still pending in the shared review queue, with no findings yet and no review approval inferred. External final-head receipts will be retained in the PR body. Existing local health advisories remain covered by pm-ts-starter-health-legacy-1027. No SDK gap or upstream issue was filed; linked npm install environment required clearing inherited allow-scripts as documented above."
  "2026-11-07T02:04:46.369Z",codex-agent,"Review round: fetched all review threads and comments (one unresolved thread PRRT_kwDOSZpwFM60tmMd; no pagination gaps); latest CodeRabbit review has no outside-diff findings. Remote head is current and origin/main is an ancestor, so no merge is needed. Confirmed inherited private registry plus null user config can break public fixture installs. Preserve credential isolation required by the queue rules: explicitly select the public registry and isolate npm/Bun configuration for generated public-package consumers. Add behavioral regressions with synthetic hostile registry/configuration inputs; inspect the complete PR diff for similar paths. Keep all tracker history append-only."
  "2026-11-07T02:08:03.116Z",codex-agent,"Confirmed the review finding and applied a credential-free public-registry environment shared by generated npm/Bun installs. Synthetic inherited default/scoped registries, user config and Bun home config cannot divert fixture installs. Self-review exposed a second generated-consumer issue: fresh Bun installs may contain both nested SDK and hoisted codec versions; retain the SDK-owned copy while removing only the disposable top-level copy. Full-gate budget evidence: prior successful CI run 42279731772 took 62m44s npm + 64m05s Bun on Node 22, and 74m32s npm + 73m48s Bun on Node 26. Local full release gates exceed the requested approximately 60-minute budget; CI will certify them. Typecheck, test typecheck, lint, build, docstring (14 files/53 declarations) and duplication (0%, 43 sources) pass at unchanged thresholds. Initial local health exposed global extension version skew; installing the exact CI project extension removes it. The inherited provenance advisory remains tracked by pm-ts-starter-health-legacy-1027; no history was repaired."
  "2026-11-07T02:12:06.168Z",codex-agent,"Review PRRT_kwDOSZpwFM60tmMd is fixed by credential-free public-registry isolation; authenticated host credentials are deliberately never read or forwarded. Self-review also fixed the fresh Bun nested/hoisted codec collision. Disposable-copy behavioral revert proofs with the fixed tests retained: (1) revert generatedProjectEnv to the original environment construction; node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"generated consumers select the public registry\" test/backend.test.ts fails 1/1 (exit 1), selecting the synthetic unreachable inherited registry instead of the public registry. (2) revert only the codec relocation block; node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"generated npm and Bun projects\" test/backend.test.ts fails 1/1 (exit 1) with ENOTEMPTY on an existing SDK-private codec. Restored complete backend suite passes 14/14, zero skips. The package worktree was never mutated for these proofs. Linked verification: node_modules/.bin/pm test pm-ts-starter-sdk-toon-codec --run --progress --timeout 900 passes 1/1 linked command, whose node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/backend.test.ts passes 14/14, zero skips. Additional isolated-Git validation: node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/smoke.test.ts test/compatibility-floor.test.ts test/manifest-vocabulary.test.ts test/package-metadata.test.ts test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts passes 138/138, zero skips. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run lint, npm run build, npm run docstring (14 files/53 declarations), npm run duplication (0%, 43 sources), npm run audit:prod (0 vulnerabilities), npm run pack:dry-run, npm run verify:release-publish-attestation and npm run verify:release-changelog-date all pass at unchanged thresholds. Rebuilt committed dist has no drift. node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers passes all gate-failing checks after installing the same project extension as CI; the single inherited provenance advisory remains unchanged and tracked separately. All changed history streams preserve existing HEAD and main prefixes. Whole PR source/test/docs diff self-reviewed; no additional finding or SDK gap remains. After claim release, regenerate and check the changelog, commit these records with the tests/docs and verify the final commit identity. Full npm/Bun release gates are left to fresh-head CI per the recorded 63-75 minute prior-gate timings. External check entrypoint: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/pull/197/checks. No threads replied to or resolved, no merge or release."
